<description>&lt;p&gt;IS-linked militants attacked an Ebola clinic in eastern DR Congo, forcing patients to flee and killing dozens of civilians, while the Allied Democratic Forces launched an assault in North Kivu that killed 33 villagers. The United Nations mission is scheduled to leave the country in December, and the United States has sanctioned Rwanda’s defence ministry and its military bank Zigama. Joseph Kabila now leads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has seized positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with government troops. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/europe/europe-migrants-rwanda.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOY3hDQ29FQUxyUUVZV2RBUUFUX0RoUDhEUE40Y3p1VTZ0RTdNakF1QU9OOXkxaWQ1VUdRM09ETVdvaUgxeE1qTXJqSDkzUElaNW1NTmZDUFZ1TGw0bmhud3hDbjBpdjVLRVFLYTdSSHMtZ0tqNDhyRzZMM3FFdUdab21qLWNQek0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUjdvMzhsUExDa2lhS3Z4VmpOVlhEWldzTUN2SFhBZFpfVXEtZ0RnNW9mRGFfTnVMTnhKUEdGMGpSR1MyS3lGTTBINE92Zkl0S1AtSHdFaUFIQVZNTXczZW05LWtaUm5CUkZCRTFLbTF2WGZhbDRNYy1uOERxekdIOC1RSDBodVBDdlRIdnlubHN3d0pzMC1WbmU4MHV1aXF3Nm8tX1NCMUUtaUluNnRQUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNN3JqVE5oS3U1T1F3cGc0MWxXQ0FPT1FLUnN1ZzlUUGVXOVBIZnlUcEFZXzNqc1NKdjFyVThYVkhmZU9NODJCR3I4Yjhack9VM3FDREFzR3p6TmUyQ1F2RXUwcGRfdm1jakc1